<tr height="400" valign="top" >
<td style=" color:#000000; font-size:12pt; background-color:#FFFFFF; font-family:arial; bLabel:main; bEditID:r3st1;" tEditID="c1r1" locked="0" aEditID="c1r1" >
<![CDATA[<span id="docs-internal-guid-eff69b9e-6b33-bb56-9c85-f6a3a9d466dc"><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">{!Contact.FirstName},</span></p><br><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Thank you for your interest in the PhD in the Learning, Literacies and Technologies program at Arizona State University.</span></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"> </span></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Take some time and review the program information on our</span><a href="https://education.asu.edu/teacher-education-degree-programs/phd-edd/doctor-of-philosophy-in-learning-literacies-and-technologies" style="text-decoration:none;"><span style="font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"> </span><span style="font-family: Arial; color: rgb(17, 85, 204); text-decoration: underline; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">website</span></a><span style="font-family: Arial; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">, where you can gather the most current program information. &nbsp;Also, please feel free to review this comprehensive program guide (</span><a href="https://education.asu.edu/sites/default/files/LLT-PhD-Program-Guide_0.pdf" style="text-decoration:none;"><span style="font-family: Arial; color: rgb(17, 85, 204); text-decoration: underline; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">PDF</span></a><span style="font-family: Arial; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">) that describes the degree program in detail and includes an FAQ section. </span></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"> </span></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">We are currently accepting applications for fall 2015. If you are ready to apply, I encourage you to start your</span><a href="https://webapp4.asu.edu/dgsadmissions/Index.jsp" style="text-decoration:none;"><span style="font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"> </span><span style="font-family: Arial; color: rgb(17, 85, 204); text-decoration: underline; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">application for admission</span></a><span style="font-family: Arial; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">. Priority deadline for applications is </span><span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">December 15, 2014</span><span style="font-family: Arial; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">. Applications submitted after the deadline will only be considered if funding and space are available.</span></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"> </span></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Please take the time to register for an upcoming information session, as this is a prime opportunity for you to gather all the information you need to begin the application process, and learn more about the program offerings. You can register for our next information session </span><a href="https://education.asu.edu/resources/events" style="text-decoration:none;"><span style="font-family: Arial; color: rgb(17, 85, 204); text-decoration: underline; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">here</span></a><span style="font-family: Arial; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">. </span></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"> </span></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">If you have any additional questions, please feel free to contact me.</span></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"> </span></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Again, thank you for your interest in this exciting program. I look forward to hearing from you.</span></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"> </span></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Anita Youmara</span></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Administrative Secretary | Interim Student Support Specialist</span></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Division of Educational Leadership and Innovation</span></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><a href="http://education.asu.edu/" style="text-decoration:none;"><span style="font-family: Arial; color: rgb(17, 85, 204); text-decoration: underline; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Mary Lou Fulton Teachers College</span></a></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Phone: 480-727-6928</span></p><div><span style="font-family: Arial; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><br></span></div></span>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>